# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py) and the strings' own test (0.4, FX's third page): FX three times to
# Strings; Mix up from 0 (a 4 s wash in), each knob turned (Chord through its jumps, Tone, Length, Hollow on SEL +
# Tone); a Tuning change (the chord's fifths the Tuning's); a scene recall that takes the strings down and back; Mix
# to 0 (a 4 s wash out); then the strings again and a stop: with the delay and the reverb out, the output under
# -120 dB within 40 s of the stop (a string held at a quiet level for good, the lines' limit cycle, can't come back)
pressure w0 0
pressure w1 0
notips
set 71 24
set 74 0
press SEL
tapkey w8
release SEL
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
expect view 15
shot strings-off.png
press SAVE
tapkey w0
release SAVE
wav strings.wav
spin K1 60
wait 6000
shot strings-on.png
expect par112 60
spin K2 50
wait 4000
spin K2 -50
wait 3000
spin K3 -40
wait 3000
spin K3 40
wait 2000
spin K4 -50
wait 4000
spin K4 50
wait 2000
press SEL
spin K3 -60
wait 300
shot strings-sel.png
wait 3000
spin K3 60
release SEL
wait 2000
expect par116 60
set 110 7
wait 4000
set 110 0
wait 2000
press SAVE
tapkey w1
release SAVE
tapkey w0
wait 3000
expect par112 0
tapkey w1
wait 6000
expect par112 60
spin K1 -60
wait 5000
spin K1 60
wait 5000
set 62 0
set 63 0
wait 1000
tap PLAY
wait 39000
peakreset
wait 1000
expect peak_db_max -120
